50 — PERFORMANCE RULE

The site should feel calm because it is technically calm.

Avoid:

- unnecessary video backgrounds
- enormous JavaScript bundles
- excessive animation
- autoplay media
- visual effects that delay content

The architecture should load before the spectacle.

Prefer:

HTML → structure → content → enhancement

